# The aircraft

::: {.callout-tip}
## Initial user specifications

1. Wingspan: 736.6 mm (29 in)
2. Length: 501.65 mm (19.75 in)
3. Wheel diameter: 50.8 mm (2 in)
:::

::: {.callout-tip}
## Published figures to reproduce

1. Dry mass: 531.5 g (1.2 lb)
2. CG: 69.85 mm (2.75 in) from leading edge
:::

::: {.callout-note}
## Initial assumptions

1. Airfoil: flat Maker Foam plate.
2. Planform is fitted to photographs.
3. Powered by dual brushless 2206 motors.
4. Wing area and wing loading are not published.
5. Battery: 2200 mAh 3-cell.
6. Thrust not published.
:::


